Task: Design and create database schema (users, books, user_books)

Summary:
- Created initial SQL migration with three core tables
- Added TypeScript types matching the database schema

Tables created:
- profiles: id, display_name, avatar_url, timestamps
- books: id, open_library_id, isbn, title, author, cover_url, etc.
- user_books: id, user_id, book_id, loan_status, loan relationships

Features:
- Auto-create profile trigger on auth.users insert
- Loan status enum: available, lent, borrowed
- Updated_at triggers for all tables
- Foreign key relationships with cascade delete

Files created:
- supabase/migrations/001_initial_schema.sql
- src/types/database.ts

Why: Establishes the data model for the book lending platform,
enabling user bookshelves and loan tracking.
